{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"33904","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:33904","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_200578","characterName":"全射郎","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200578","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"360917"}]},"originalCharacterName":"全射郎","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"因身為男嬰而被遺棄在深山，被「男斗性拳」的掌門收養。在他的眼中，女人都是復仇的對象，兇殘暴戾的可怕生物…對於女性的仇恨成就了他對「男斗性拳」異於常人的天賦。托付著整個「男斗性拳」的寄望，參加地上最強格鬥大會！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200578"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8c/8c894ed8b2430abef985a2ea5f40fed7471a75ac89a272641ba4a3adbada6b6f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0c2d5106299555bbbf4649ca9750420984f11b2d02bb05666b67ab3cf28dc963.webp","width":221,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_200579","characterName":"凱婷","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"200579","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"360917"}]},"originalCharacterName":"凱婷","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"毒舌的古惑女，刁蠻任性。以香港潮流地標—旺角為出沒地點。性格貪慕虛榮，終極夢想是嫁給有錢帥哥，短期目標是由劏房搬到公屋…"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"200579"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/67/67afe4e5c9a3c7a0d85fc51577c9df02bc